# Relative links that leave spec/ on purpose. The mirror carries only spec/, so
# every entry is a link that is dead there; scripts/check-spec-selfcontained.py
# fails on any other link that leaves spec/, and on an entry that matches no link.
#
# One entry per line: <source> -> <target>
#   source  Markdown file under spec/, path from the repository root
#   target  where the link resolves, path from the repository root (not the text
#           as written: ../../../README.md in spec/v1.0/examples/README.md
#           is README.md)
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# No entry: a document of the source repository is linked by its absolute
# https://github.com/hop-top/poly-pact URL, which resolves on the mirror too.
